                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "58609b4f-86d7-3e26-9636-4da5d8bae5c0",
                        "entry_id": "39caa9b8-cba2-3318-ab0e-08b12be16658",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hangover."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "10d1160b-d9b0-4567-ae4b-f6ef64d43618",
                                "sense_id": "58609b4f-86d7-3e26-9636-4da5d8bae5c0",
                                "text": "Also, I had found my way into the realm of the mind, and I was intellectually intoxicated. (Alas! as I was to learn at a later period, intellectual intoxication too, has its katzenjammer.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49856895-f741-47c2-a448-a8c35275deb9",
                                "sense_id": "58609b4f-86d7-3e26-9636-4da5d8bae5c0",
                                "text": "In those days a still-birth brought as high as ten dollars and after riding the shoot-the-chutes we always left a little stale beer for the morning because the finest thing in the world for Katzenjammer is a glass of stale beer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f812d6f-e0e6-3c29-8f80-87dbf3e0f190",
                        "entry_id": "39caa9b8-cba2-3318-ab0e-08b12be16658",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Jitters; discord; confusion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6814b49-3e61-4fc8-a7b6-0a516f0d813e",
                                "sense_id": "3f812d6f-e0e6-3c29-8f80-87dbf3e0f190",
                                "text": "Tell you the truth, I've had an intimation from the State Department—unofficially, of course—that whenever a soldier of fortune demands a fleet of gunboats in a case of revolutionary katzenjammer, I should cut the cable, give him all the tobacco he wants, and after he's shot take his clothes, if they fit me, for part payment of my salary."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa4f357b-9017-3162-a3e4-167482b37072",
                        "entry_id": "39caa9b8-cba2-3318-ab0e-08b12be16658",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Depression."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
