                                "sense_id": "23637397-a47c-39bc-bb64-49e64999a543",
                                "text": "He is naked to the waist to show the plump white arms and shoulders and the satiny skin of the voluptuary; one of those men whose heads and whose stomachs are too loyal ever to give them Katzenjammer or remorse."
